<title>TURKEY: Turkish PM says big budget difficulties emerging.</title>
<headline>Turkish PM says big budget difficulties emerging.</headline>
<dateline>ANKARA 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkey's Islamist prime minister, Necmettin Erbakan, said on Tuesday the national budget, targeted to be balanced for 1997, had begun having serious difficulties in March.</p>
<p>&quot;The budget was balanced in the first and second months. I am following it closely and in the third month big difficulties began to emerge,&quot; he told his party meeting in parliament.</p>
</text>
